# Per-image diagnostic renders backing docs/validation_ap_completeness.md.
# The contact sheets that the doc actually embeds are tracked; the ~286 GB of
# per-image overlays behind them (~286 MB) are not.
docs/public/validation_completeness/boxes/
docs/public/validation_completeness/polygons/

# Panel caches written next to the figures they build (scripts/make_*_figure.py
# --from-cache). Re-derived from the result files in one pass; the figure itself
# is what belongs in the repo, not the ~12 MB of intermediate arrays behind it.
docs/public/*.panels.npz

# Per-tile AP40-vs-AP60 close-ups behind notes/ap40_vs_ap60_visual.md. Same rule
# as validation_completeness above: the four summary figures the note embeds are
# tracked, the 15 whole-tile contact sheets (73 MB) are regenerated on demand
# with scripts/visualize_ap40_vs_ap60.py --out-dir docs/public/ap40_vs_ap60/allen.
docs/public/ap40_vs_ap60/allen/
